# TwoSum

## Ingredients
1. Nums ({15, 11, 2, 7, 10, 29, 0})
1. Target (9)
1. i (1)
1. j (2)
1. tmp (0)
1. found (0)

## Instructions
1. repeat until i > 4 or found is 1:
1.   repeat until j > 4 or found is 1:
1.     add Nums's#i and Nums's#j to tmp!
1.     if tmp is Target: add 1 to found!
1.     if tmp is not Target: add 1 to j!
1.   repeat!
1.   if found is not 1: add 1 to i!
1.   if found is not 1: add i and 1 to j!
1. repeat!
1. if found is 1: serve i!
1. if found is 1: serve " "!
1. if found is 1: serve j!
1. if found is 1: serve "\n"!

